; fennec.fur.form — the CLIENT form primitive (Form.signal) + codec-driven HTML5 attrs
; (Form.input_attrs), bound to a Sift codec. Pure over Fur's isomorphic signals + the jsoo-safe
; Sift lib (validate / field_view / field_required), so a SPA form gets the SAME refinement
; validation the server's Fennec_web.Form enforces — reactively, offline. Runs native (SSR/tests)
; and compiles to JavaScript for the browser bundle. Server-side Fennec_web.Form re-exports it, so
; the three form stories share one Form name, one codec, one Sift.error shape.

(library
 (name fennec_fur_form)
 (public_name fennec.fur.form)
 (wrapped false) ; expose the module as top-level [Form] (like fennec.fur.html) so .mlx writes [Form.signal]
 (modes byte native)
 (libraries fennec.fur fennec.pulse.sift)
 (inline_tests
  (backend fennec-hunt.runner))
 (preprocess
  (pps fennec-hunt.ppx)))
